---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../../lib/site';
const lang = 'zh' as const;
---
<Layout
  title={`隐私政策 — ${SITE.name}`}
  description="摘要页；完整以英文为准。"
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
  lang={lang}
>
  <div class="page-head wrap">
    <h1>隐私政策</h1>
    <p>摘要页；完整以英文为准。</p>
  </div>

  <article class="section wrap prose">
    <p>完整政策以 <a href="/privacy/">英文 Privacy</a> 为准。摘要：上传图约 30 天删除；可选 GA4 / Adsterra；支付经 Waffo；生成经 fal；P0 不需要 R2。</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
